🥳 Hello, everyone from Steam, hello everyone!
Thank you for your continuous attention and support to Ghost Road. We will continue to update and release the latest developments in game development here.
In this issue, we will report on our project achievements and progress in the past few weeks.
Completed work:

📖 Script: The entire game script has been completed
Character design:

🦊 Characters: All characters are drawn, and some of the characters' expressions are in the final production process;

🎑 Scene: There are several specific scenes in intense production;

🎹 Music: Background music production in Qingqiu Wonderland;

🎙 Dubbing: More than 10 characters such as Black and White Wuchang, Ma Hu, Ying, and Xia Ji have been dubbed, while voice teachers such as Luo Xiaoyan, Su Qingqing, Lianyue, and Meng Po are still recording;

🎨 CG&Illustration: Most of the plot illustrations have been completed, and there are still a few in the supplementary design;

💻 Program development: Integrate, optimize, and solve some bugs in everything at the end;

🦄 Peripheral products: The "Ghost Road" peripheral products have been designed, and currently, crowdfunding is being initiated on the Modian crowdfunding platform, waiting for approval.

👻 Promotion and operation: On the small black box, we held a voting and lottery event to determine the selling price of the game release, as well as activities such as adding a wish list and drawing a CDKEY.

📢 This issue is a summary of the research and development work in the past few weeks, and the latest news will be updated and released to players irregularly in the future.

For those who like 'Ghost Road', please add a 'Wish List' to follow us. Thank you very much for your support!
