🥳 Hello, everyone from Steam, hello everyone!
Thank you for your continuous attention and support to Ghost Road. We will continue to update and release the latest developments in game development here.
In this issue, we will summarize our project achievements and progress over the past few months.

📖 Script: The entire game script has been completed with approximately 200000 words;

🦊 Character: The entire game has 21 characters, including the main storyline female lead, NPC, and branch storyline ghost. Most of the vertical drawings and bust portraits have been completed, and some of the bust portraits and character expressions are still under intense production;

🎑 Scene: More than 10 scenes related to the underworld have been designed and produced, and there are more than ten scenes about the memories of the Republic of China period and the demon world in the plot that require 3D assistance for production, which is quite cumbersome and currently under intense production;

🎹 Music: Background music is a major feature of our game, and each song has been meticulously produced and repeatedly polished by the arranger. Combining the plot and scene characteristics, the melody is very touching. Currently, a total of 12 songs have been completed, including the theme song. Some have been released on Bilibili and NetEase Cloud Music, and other songs will be released according to the progress of the scene;

🎙 CV: The completed characters include Su Mei, Jiaxin, Ah Hua, etc. Dubbing is a challenging task involving a wide range of production personnel, as it needs to be done according to the CV timbre and schedule, so the progress in this area is about 30%;

🎨 CG&Illustration: 5 main plot CG images have been completed, and more than 30 plot illustrations have been completed, and supplementary designs are still ongoing.

📢 This issue is a summary of all previous research and development work, and will update and release the latest news to the majority of players from time to time in the future.
For those who like 'Ghost Road', please add a 'Wish List' to follow us. Thank you very much!
